ng mengada-ada.","enText":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"I do not ask you for the Qur'an any payment, and I am not of the pretentious","readText":"qul m\u0101 as`alukum 'alaihi min ajriw wa m\u0101 ana minal-mutakallif\u012bn","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/038086.mp3","juz":23,"manzil":6,"page":458,"ruku":395,"hizbQuarter":183,"sajda":false},{"verseId":87,"ayahText":"\u0627\u0650\u0646\u0652 \u0647\u064f\u0648\u064e \u0627\u0650\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0627 \u0630\u0650\u0643\u0652\u0631\u064c \u0644\u0650\u0651\u0644\u0652\u0639\u0670\u0644\u064e\u0645\u0650\u064a\u0652\u0646\u064e","indoText":"(Al-Qur'an) ini tidak lain hanyalah peringatan bagi seluruh alam.","enText":"It is but a reminder to the worlds.","readText":"in huwa ill\u0101 \u017cikrul lil-'\u0101lam\u012bn","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/038087.mp3","juz":23,"manzil":6,"page":458,"ruku":395,"hizbQuarter":183,"sajda":false},{"verseId":88,"ayahText":"\u0648\u064e\u0644\u064e\u062a\u064e\u0639\u0652\u0644\u064e\u0645\u064f\u0646\u0651\u064e \u0646\u064e\u0628\u064e\u0627\u064e\u0647\u0657 \u0628\u064e\u0639\u0652\u062f\u064e \u062d\u0650\u064a\u0652\u0646\u064d","indoText":"Dan sungguh, kamu akan mengetahui (kebenaran) beritanya (Al-Qur'an) setelah beberapa waktu lagi.\u201d","enText":"And you will surely know [the truth of] its information after a time.\"","readText":"wa lata'lamunna naba`ah\u1ee5 ba'da \u1e25\u012bn","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/038088.mp3","juz":23,"manzil":6,"page":458,"ruku":395,"hizbQuarter":183,"sajda":false}]}";}